Language English

Book DungeonCave Ordered No Keep Looped

	Page ExploreViaCrypt
		Not Visible
		Triggered By @ExploreDungeonCaveViaCrypt

		Prolog """
			The space gets darker the farther you look. 
			
			An investigator in this Sight token's space may look deeper.
		"""
		Button "Explore"
		Free
		
		Remove TokenExploreDungeonCaveViaCrypt
		Remove TokenExploreDungeonCaveViaBasement
		Add TileTortureChamber, TokenDungeonCaveWall!
		
		Text """
			When you turn a corner, you are surprised to see a cave hewn from
			the rock. Flickering torches make shadows dance slowly on the walls.

			
			Place the {c:TileTortureChamber} tile and a wall as indicated, then
			discard all Sight and Explore tokens leading to the explored area.
		"""
		
		exploredDungeonCaveViaCrypt = true
		exploredDungeonCave = true
		Goto PlaceExploreTortureChamber
	End Page ExploreViaCrypt

	Page ExploreViaBasement
		Not Visible
		Triggered By @ExploreDungeonCaveViaBasement

		Prolog """
			The door looks clean and well-used. An investigator in the
			basement can open it.
		"""
		Button "Explore"
		
		Remove TokenExploreDungeonCaveViaBasement, TokenDungeonCaveWall
		Add TileTortureChamber
		
		Text """
			When you open the door, you find the back of another door which you
			push open. Once it is open, you are surprised to see a large cave
			hewn from the rock. Flickering torches make shadows dance slowly on the walls.

			
			Place the {c:TileTortureChamber} tile, then discard Sight and
			Explore tokens leading to the explored area.
		"""
		
		If exploredDungeonCave Then Text """
			When you open the door, you find the back of another door which you
			push open. <<This is the cave we found earlier,>> you comment.
			
			Discard this Explore token and the wall under it.
		"""
		
		exploredDungeonCave = true
		exploredDungeonCaveViaBasement = true
		If Not exploredCrypt Then Goto PlaceExploreCrypt
	End Page ExploreViaBasement

	Page PlaceExploreCrypt
		Not Visible
		
		Add TokenExploreCryptViaDungeonCave!
		
		Text """
			The cave continues into the darkness. Place a Sight token as
			indicated.
		"""
		
		exploredDungeonCave = true
		Goto PlaceExploreTortureChamber
	End Page PlaceExploreCrypt
	
	Page PlaceExploreTortureChamber
		Not Visible
		
		Add TokenExploreTortureChamberViaDungeonCave!
		Text """
			A door in the wall leads... somewhere. Place an Explore token as
			indicated.
		"""
	
		Trigger @MoveAfterExplore
		Exit
	End Page PlaceExploreTortureChamber
End Book DungeonCave